---
// src/pages/status.astro
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>System Status | Dayront</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Dayront system status. Learn about our 100% client-side architecture and reliability." />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page-wrapper">
    <main class="status-card">
      
      <!-- Header -->
      <header class="header">
        <h1>System Status</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Last updated: Always real-time</p>
      </header>

      <!-- Main Status Indicator -->
      <div class="status-indicator">
        <span class="pulse-container">
          <span class="pulse-ring"></span>
          <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
        </span>
        <span class="status-text">All Systems Operational</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Explanation -->
      <section class="explanation">
        <h2>Architecture Overview</h2>
        <p>
          Dayront is a <strong>100% client-side application</strong>. We use WebAssembly (FFmpeg) to process your audio and video files entirely within your browser.
        </p>
        <p>
          This means <strong>there are no backend servers</strong> processing your media. There is no server-side downtime, no queue times, and your files never leave your device.
        </p>

        <h2>External Dependencies</h2>
        <p>
          The only external service we rely on is Vercel's static Edge Network to serve the application files and the FFmpeg engine. You can view their live status below:
        </p>
        <a href="https://www.vercel-status.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link">
          View Vercel Status Page →
        </a>
      </section>

      <!-- Footer / CTA -->
      <footer class="footer">
        <p>Experiencing an issue with a specific tool? Let us know.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn">Contact Support</a>
      </footer>

    </main>
  </div>
</body>

<style>
  /* Scoped CSS for this page only */
  .page-wrapper {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background-color: #f9fafb;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 2rem 1rem;
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  }

  .status-card {
    background: white;
    max-width: 500px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
  }

  .header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .header h1 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #111827;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #6b7280;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .status-indicator {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    background-color: #f0fdf4;
    border: 1px solid #dcfce7;
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .pulse-container {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    height: 12px;
    width: 12px;
  }

  .pulse-ring {
    position: absolute;
    display: inline-flex;
    height: 100%;
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #4ade80;
    opacity: 0.75;
    animation: ping 1.5s cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1) infinite;
  }

  .pulse-dot {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-flex;
    border-radius: 50%;
    height: 12px;
    width: 12px;
    background-color: #22c55e;
  }

  @keyframes ping {
    75%, 100% {
      transform: scale(2.5);
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  .status-text {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #166534;
  }

  .explanation h2 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #111827;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .explanation p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #374151;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #2563eb;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .link:hover {
    color: #1d4ed8;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .footer {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .footer p {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #6b7280;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: #2563eb;
    color: white;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.2s;
  }

  .btn:hover {
    background-color: #1d4ed8;
  }
</style>
